{"id":"wb-5-199","name":"白云观","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"白云观","text":"白云观，位于北京市西城区西便门外的白云观街9号，是道教全真道三大祖庭之一，也是全真道龙门派的祖庭，自元朝起，为全真道“第一丛林”。中国道教协会、中国道教学院、中国道教文化研究所等机构设于该观内。白云观过去每年春节举办的庙会，游人如鲫，热闹非凡。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%99%BD%E4%BA%91%E8%A7%82","revisionId":94951169,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94951169","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/02ec2813777cb9371e9738bf.jpg","title":"WhiteCloudpic1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:WhiteCloudpic1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/WhiteCloudpic1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Gene Zhang","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","caption":"The White Cloud Temple gate — in Beijing.","width":320,"height":240}}